<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the eight-nation</p>
<p>Dunhill Cup soccer tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>    Bosnia    4     Vietnam    0   (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Muharemovic Jzelaludin (28th minute), Sanin Pintol</p>
<p>(44th, 89th), Smjecanindzemo (67th)</p>
<p>    Zimbabwe  0     Indonesia  0</p>
